                <mxCell id="note" value="The contract gate runs when the connector starts, not on each object. Nothing publishes to P2. Reconciliation is a worker timer, not a queue message. &lt;br&gt;A failed graph write waits out the 60 second visibility timeout and is received again. A matching content hash still writes the graph." style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Courier New;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" parent="1" vertex="1">
